      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🚀 AutoHunt Master Automation\n**Features included:**\n1. **Periodic 3-Hour Poller & On-Demand Webhook**\n2. **Heartbeat / Watchdog Health Verification**\n3. **Scheduled Interview Detection & Dedicated Telegram Alerting**\n4. **Tier 1 (Unicorn), Tier 2 (High Fit), Tier 3 Categorization**\n5. **Prepared Data Rows for Google Sheets / Notion CRM**\n6. **Self-Healing: Autonomous Pipeline Trigger when backlog is low**\n7. **Audit Event logging directly inside AutoHunt**",
